<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields continue to fall.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields continue to fall.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three, six and 12-month treasury bills fell by 0.09, 0.16 and 0.07 percentage points respectively at Wednesday's auction, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,183	     1,288	  10.58 (10.67)</p>
<p>    6 months     1,463		 874	  11.62 (11.78)</p>
<p>    12 months	665		 520	  12.72 (12.79)</p>
<p>    Total	  4,311	     2,682</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>- -Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
